    "thirdPartyServicesDescription": "We use third-party services to enhance our App:\n\n• Wiredash: Used to collect user feedback.\n• RevenueCat: Used to process in-app purchases and subscriptions.\n• Sentry: Used for error monitoring and crash reporting.",
